Install @axe-core/playwright. In every Playwright test, after page.goto(), call:
  import AxeBuilder from '@axe-core/playwright';
  const results = await new AxeBuilder({ page }).analyze();
  expect(results.violations).toEqual([]);
Configure axe with the project's color scheme — dark-mode backgrounds need explicit contrast ratios. Run against all authenticated and unauthenticated routes. Document any deliberate suppressions (e.g. third-party embeds) in axe.config.ts with owner and justification.
